## Cross-thread notices

Conductor-written, in the project layer: at most five dated entries, each with an expiry, for what
every thread must know now (a provider outage, capacity limit, moratorium, or
initiative that changes sequencing). An agent that needs one proposes the
exact line and expiry to the conductor; that request is a permitted narrow
coordination message, like a category request. Kept at the tail so an update
invalidates the least cache prefix.
